{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52277","headline":"诗（幷序） 三十八 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 三十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有钱惜不吃，身死留（一作「由」）妻儿。\n只得纸钱送，欠少元不知。\n门前空言语，还将纸作衣。\n除非梦里见，触体更何时。\n独守深泉下，冥冥长夜饥。\n忆想（一作「相」）平生日，悔不着罗衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}